      "currentBoundStringTable": {
        "item_3084_tooltip": "<passive>庞然吞食</passive> 每个目标{{ Item_Cooldown }}<br>如果一个敌方英雄在附近度过了@TotalDemolishTime@秒，那么你的下一次对其打出的攻击会造成<physicalDamage>@BaseDamage@外加@MaxHPRatio*100@%</physicalDamage>你的最大生命值的<physicalDamage>额外物理伤害</physicalDamage>，并提供相当于<scaleHealth>@DamageToMaxHealthRatio*100@%该伤害值</scaleHealth>的<scaleHealth>最大生命值</scaleHealth>。<br><br><passive>歌利亚巨人</passive><br>每有<scaleHealth>@HealthSizeThreshold@最大生命值</scaleHealth>，获得@SizeAmount*100@%体型提升，至多至@SizeCap*100@%。 ",
        "item_3084_tooltipdynamic": "{{ Item_Passive_List }}<li><passive>庞然吞食：</passive>当@DistanceToChampion@码内有一名敌方英雄时，会在@TotalDemolishTime@秒里持续充能一次对英雄的强力攻击。充能攻击会造成<physicalDamage><scalehealth>@DamageProcCalc@</scalehealth>额外物理伤害</physicalDamage>，并为你提供<scaleHealth>@ProcHealthGain@永久最大生命值</scaleHealth>。对每个目标有(@PerTargetCooldown@{{ Item_Cooldown }})。<br><br>{{ Item_Mythic_Passive }} <attention>%i:scaleHealth% @MythicPassiveHealthPercentage*100@%</attention>生命值提升和<attention>@SizePerLegendary*100@%</attention>英雄体型。",
        "item_3084_tooltipextended": "{{Item_3084_Tooltip}}",
        "generatedtip_item_3084_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleHealth%@FlatHPPoolMod@</attention>生命值<br><attention>%i:scaleHPRegen%@PercentBaseHPRegenMod*100@%</attention>基础生命回复</section><section><passive>庞然吞食</passive> 每个目标{{ Item_Cooldown }}<br>如果一个敌方英雄在附近度过了@TotalDemolishTime@秒，那么你的下一次对其打出的攻击会造成<physicalDamage>@BaseDamage@外加@MaxHPRatio*100@%</physicalDamage>你的最大生命值的<physicalDamage>额外物理伤害</physicalDamage>，并提供相当于<scaleHealth>@DamageToMaxHealthRatio*100@%该伤害值</scaleHealth>的<scaleHealth>最大生命值</scaleHealth>。<br><br><passive>歌利亚巨人</passive><br>每有<scaleHealth>@HealthSizeThreshold@最大生命值</scaleHealth>，获得@SizeAmount*100@%体型提升，至多至@SizeCap*100@%。 </section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>"
      },
